Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:46.56,Title,0,0,0,0,,《透明人2》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我叫戴文·威利尔斯 医学博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Devin Villiers, M.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的项链非常吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't help noticing your lovely necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你从事哪方面的工作？威利尔斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's your area of specialty, Dr. Villiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kill monkeys,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也杀老鼠 沙鼠 偶尔也杀猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}As well as rats, gerbils, the occasional potbellied pig,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过主要是杀猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的意思是医学研究 亲爱的 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He means medical research, dear. - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确是喜欢杀猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just like to kill monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不早了 我们该走了 晚安 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late. We should be going. Good night, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚和他搞得开心点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go easy on him tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能救救我啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那东西在哪里？-我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我情况越来越不稳定了 - 我真的没有 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm getting worse. - I don't have it, swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我装了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fuck with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你一定要相信我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you gotta believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那缓冲剂 戴文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that buffer now, Devin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西锁在保险库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked in a vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能拿出来 其他人也不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get to it, nobody can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就多做点出来 - 不 我不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then make some more. - No, no, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有谁会？谁会做缓冲剂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who? Who can make the buffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉！马吉·道尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie! Maggie Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她负责合成化合物的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}She synthesized the compound, did the research.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有她 其他人都不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else, just her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉·道尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跟别人说你见过我 事实上你也看不见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell anyone I was here. You never even saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我能看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 洗手间里面有个人在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, there's a guy in the bathroom, bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去叫救护车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need paramedics in here right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会发生这种事故？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could we have let this slip by?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是睡着了吧？-我？没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sleeping on the job? - Me? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在想事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just deep in thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 看上去像睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 40 winks deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么发现吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 他们说这个人是个烂人 总在派对上搅和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they said he was pretty trashed, committed some serious party fouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,按理说疑犯的身上有血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assume our suspect's covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离开这里的时候怎么会没人发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he walk out of here unnoticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是赤脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And barefoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 新发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶器是手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death by cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前仅有的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把手机卡拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He popped the SlM card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说得到了死者的通讯录\N{\fnArial\fs30}So somebody's got his address book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情况不是大乐观啊 - 是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That can't be good. - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 现场还没处理完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, we're not finished in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天呐！-不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My God! - Excuse me, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这位探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人是我的一位助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man was one of my staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 让我说明一下 可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize. May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莱塞研究所的 威廉·莱塞博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. William Reisner, of the Reisner Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷德蒙的智囊团 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think tank over in Redmond. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过必要时 我们做的比想的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on occasion, we do more than think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,您对这有什么看法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any thoughts on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经通知国防部了 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We contract to the Pentagon, Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你也知道 我们的对手非常多\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I'm sure you can imagine, we have a long list of enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不过我希望你能到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, well, we'd love to get a statement from you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在这里由我们接管 - 凭什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll be taking over from here. - On whose authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经知会了你的上级 希望你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've cleared it with your superiors, if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们授权了让你们破坏现场吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They clear you to contaminate the crime scene, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那现在可以了吗？-嗯 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we good now? - Yeah, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上手套 我要取了一片手指甲回去化验…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make sure Forensics bags the hands, I want to get a fingernail…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到上校的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all heard the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我听到上校的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's let it go, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这样不管这事吗？这不是我的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're rolling over on this? It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部那边已经下了指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}DOD's calling the shots on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱塞跟国防部有密切关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reisner's hooked in with the Pentagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就让他们接管这案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're letting them investigate themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.41,0:09:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有说我心甘情愿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I say I liked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这又不是什么国家政务 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this isn't Halliburton overcharging for unleaded, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:09:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一宗谋杀案 他们无权插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a murder case, they have no jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去读读爱国者法案吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read the Patriot Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想让你们去保护这个女人 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you to run a soft cover on this girl. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但不能插手案件 对吧？-没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still letting us give out tickets, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是研究所里的一位生物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the staff biologist over at the Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莱塞很紧张她的安全 - 可以做保姆哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reisner's concerned about her. - Babysitting gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你好像还不想放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're still on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 她拥有八个学位 也许你能学到点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, she's got, like, eight diplomas, you might learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看 汤姆… - 谈话结束了 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Tom… - We're done, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我胃溃疡还没发作之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before my ulcer starts bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么看 有点教养好么！（俚语）\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, were you guys born in a barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我们应该学学生物 - 嗯 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess I should've studied biology. - Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 探员 谢谢你们来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Detectives. Thank you for helping us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 轻松点 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hackles down. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是马吉·道尔顿博士 他们是特纳探员和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dr. Margaret Dalton. Margaret, these are Detectives Turner and…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马缇尼斯 我们会负责第一阶段的保安任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martinez. We'll be taking the first shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的处境很危险吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much danger do you think I'm in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体的我们也不清楚 道尔顿小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we don't know too many of the details, Miss Dalton,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只负责保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're just security.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的同事被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my colleague was murdered,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太残忍了 把我也牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brutally, from what I've been able to piece together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句实话 我希望一些更有经验的人来保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And honestly, I expected someone more senior, more in the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方那边说他们俩是队伍里面最优秀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief assures me they're two of the finest on the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放心吧 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 不过我肯定你们很自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, I'm sure you're entirely competent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 可以让我们四处检查一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Do you mind if we secure the premises?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:11:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 威廉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, William.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天早上再过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check back in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我到上面去 你请自便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be upstairs. Make yourselves comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 我只是想… - 看来得找人回来修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, I was just gonna… - I've gotta get that fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有栋1920年建的房子 也有这种问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a 1920s bungalow. Does the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,吱吱的响 像是有鬼一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creaks and groans like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你检查楼梯 我到楼上去 - 我就猜你会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You check downstairs, I'll take up. - I'm sure you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你负责楼上 我负责楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you take upstairs, I'll take down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 去吧 我没想歪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, go ahead, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你肯定？-嗯 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Yeah, why wouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢在这里听吱吱的响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it down here with the creaks and the groans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这里房子里有灭火器吗？-没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have any firearms in the house? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,平常有人来你这住吗？朋友或者亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else regularly use your place? Friends, relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有管家或者男朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a housekeeper? Boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我喜欢养狗 这是你的办公室吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a dog person, myself. This your office?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里大部分都是私人资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly just some personal stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你不介意的话 - 不 不 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you mind? - No, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢听着杂音工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rainfall noise works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要到那边看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to check in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不会有什么偷窥的癖好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess if you've got any voyeuristic tendencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以工作之便哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a great job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 我们不会干这种事情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we take pills for that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹 希瑟 在德贝大学读一年级\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kid sister, Heather. She's a freshman at U-Dub.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们关系一定不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我太关心她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'm over compensating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边已经检查完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟威利尔斯博士从事哪方面的研究？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you and Dr. Villiers working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会跟别人谈及你的案件吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you discuss your cases with strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我目前仍然受限于一项不可外泄协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still bound by a non-disclosure agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以即使我乐意 我也不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't tell you if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「仍然」是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "still"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经离开那工作六个月 我退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I haven't worked there for six months. I was let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,失业中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你过去薪酬很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite an overhead you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·莱塞的确是一个很好的雇主\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Reisner was an extremely gracious employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 楼下已经检查过了 弗兰克 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All secure downstairs, Frank. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的手机号码 把它设为紧急呼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my cell phone number. Put it on speed dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有需要的时候告诉我们 我们就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right outside if you need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话 她会留在室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us could stay inside if you'd feel more comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要了 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,门就不要锁了 这样我们能及时进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to keep that door unlocked, in case we need to get to you quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那是必须的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that standard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 但这是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 即使拥有八个学位的人也不至于那样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, anyone with eight degrees has no right to look like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好像你没注意到她那不可一世的模样似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, act like you didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她那冰冷的一双蓝眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could probably melt concrete with those blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是绿色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were green, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:16:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巡逻队吗 - 不是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bell Ranger. - Not one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,向北去了 不管怎样查一下吧 N-7953\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heading north. I'll call it in anyway. N-7953?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,刘易斯吗 我是特纳 帮我查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis, it's Turner. Get me an ID through Sea-Tac ATC.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,非警用直升飞机ATC尾数为N-7-9\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non-police Bell Ranger, tail number N-7-9.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 5-3 - 5-3\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 5-3. - 5-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 7-9-5-3 知道了 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 7-9-5-3. Got it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞定 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have fun. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点好吗 隔壁的邻居都能听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it down in there, you're gonna disturb the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 他们有更欢乐的事可以「做」才没空听我哼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they got better things to do than listen to me hum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证吗？你真的真的保证吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise? I mean, really, really promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心 - 我发誓 如果你欺骗我 我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't worry. - I swear, if you parries me, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸会宰了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad will kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是认真的 - 拜托 你知道我不会骗你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean it. - Come on. You know I'd never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我爸妈提前回家怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if my parents come home early?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:17:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸常常在附近绕一圈就回来 给我搞突击\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad sometimes drives around the block just to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go check.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.77,0:17:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把百叶窗关上 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the blinds, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始 来点挑逗的 给点激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, play with yourself a little, have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说话像是个A片导演 - 正合你意啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sound like a porn director. - You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很给力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 弗兰克 看看镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Frank, look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亚里桑那洲的肤色已经不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Arizona tan is officially gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在已经融入我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢？我自己都没发觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, how'd that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 我觉得现在很适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it. It suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给点激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这样 - 好了 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. - Okay, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What've we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是她妹妹 希瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be the sister, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你是希瑟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. It's Heather, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去像是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人不会穿成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody would actually wear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是探员 马缇尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Detective Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道她死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电脑前 窒息于一大堆资料中\N{\fnArial\fs30}At her computer, suffocated under a pile of printouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一直没人发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody found the body for days,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到腐烂发臭的味道传出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now there's some creepy bio-culture growing out of her nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有 她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那代表一点都不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means everything's not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 她确实是个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, she's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在轮到我拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think I got it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别着急嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为我看到其他人了 - 什么嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought I saw someone. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ash, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有我跟你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有我跟你 没其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley, there's nobody here. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,希瑟 对不起 我刚刚在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Heather, I'm so sorry. Something came up at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我跟外面那警察扯了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I figured as much from the stakeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是一个保护措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,见你的妹妹也需要上司授权吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against unauthorized quality time with your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是工作需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a work thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那狗屁禁止外泄协议跟我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}That non-disclosure shit does not apply to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.49,0:21:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想太多了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去看演唱会啊 跟切尔西… - 我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to the concert, take Chelsea… - I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,希瑟 真的很对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Heather, I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前的情况是比较忙 但很快就会过去了 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a crazy time right now, but it will be over soon, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.01,0:21:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会出去鬼混 随便跟一个人约炮嘿咻 然后怀孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go shoot crystal and get pregnant by some guy I barely know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.35,0:21:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是这样的人 希瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not. Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 今天的不是演唱会 是个诗歌会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it wasn't a concert, it was a poetry slam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你好好照顾她好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you just make sure she's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想进去是吗？来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want in? Yeah? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.94,0:23:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是特纳 - 我好像我听到点声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turner. - I think I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉萨刚刚进去了 也许是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa just went inside, it's probably her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在房间别出来 直到我们叫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay inside your study until you hear from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.62,0:24:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉萨 里面的情况怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa, how's everything going in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.99,0:24:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发现什么情况 我去检查一下楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all looks fine. I'm just gonna check upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.02,0:24:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 马吉现在在工作室 检查完毕后通知她一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Maggie's in her study, make sure she knows everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.31,0:24:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.60,0:24:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 探员马缇尼斯 你留在房间里别出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Detective Martinez, ma'am. Stay in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.34,0:25:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉萨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉萨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.16,0:25:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.66,0:25:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点 醒一醒 振作点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby. Come on, stay with me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:25:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.71,0:26:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.57,0:26:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.94,0:26:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留在里面 - 她还有脉搏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay inside. - Does she have a pulse?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.01,0:26:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 让我来复苏术吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - I'll do chest compressions. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.78,0:26:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one, and two, and three, and four…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.54,0:26:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点 莉萨 呼吸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on Lisa, breathe, breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.49,0:26:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one, and two, and three, and four, and five.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.79,0:26:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快醒啊！-继续！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Breathe, damn it! - Take over!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.24,0:26:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.84,0:26:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.61,0:26:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 醒一醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.91,0:26:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 探员 - 干嘛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Detective. - What!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.45,0:26:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的瞳孔已经放大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her pupils are fixed and dilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 已经没有用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, there's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.89,0:26:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各单位到自己的位置上 - 前进！前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All units, all units in position. - Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.16,0:27:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二队马上就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second team. Move into Bronco position.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.97,0:27:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绕到后面去 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take around back. - Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 看着屏幕 看着屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, watch your screens, watch your screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.00,0:27:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure the perimeter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.61,0:27:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.81,0:27:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.34,0:27:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖鲁二号 你那边是否安全？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zulu Two, are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.62,0:27:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.31,0:27:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马吉！-放在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie! - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.58,0:27:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 我知道你这有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - I know you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not here, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.79,0:27:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在上楼 各单位注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got movement upstairs. All units move into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.19,0:27:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意观察屏幕！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes on the screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.66,0:27:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？他在哪里？他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? Where is he? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.66,0:27:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你跟他说话 他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you talking to him. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.03,0:27:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.97,0:27:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达二层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.30,0:27:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上离开房间！-快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear out the room, now! Move! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.91,0:27:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,二层开火了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're firing upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.01,0:27:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.91,0:27:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回报 回报！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report, report!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.02,0:27:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持阵型 看看周边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. Asserting perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:27:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己人 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilians clearing through, hold fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.59,0:28:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 捉到他了吗？-仍在等待确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did we get him? - Still waiting on confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.42,0:28:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗林斯！-发现他了 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rollins! - Had him, Colonel Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.19,0:28:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚刚还在我们面前 - 情况怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was right here in front of us. - Bishop, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.23,0:28:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会捉住他的 - 他逃出视线范围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll get him. - I got nothing on my screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.90,0:28:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到他了吗？-看不到他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you see? - I can't see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}William?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.13,0:28:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有都是一个布局吗 你把她当诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing was a goddamn setup. You used her as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.13,0:28:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切安排都是有必要的 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our tactics were necessary. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.99,0:28:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在清楚了就别妨碍我们工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now clear out and let us do our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.27,0:28:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了我的搭档 你这狗娘养的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my partner in there, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.11,0:28:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上给我滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.55,0:28:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.64,0:28:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,手榴弹 手榴弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade, grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.42,0:28:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看不到目标！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see a goddamn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.39,0:28:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理下层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweep downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.49,0:28:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现他了 发现他了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him, I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.82,0:28:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标！干掉他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target! Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.08,0:28:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.96,0:29:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.87,0:29:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.64,0:29:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们围堵失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plummer! Watkins! We've lost containment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把照射灯撤掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those sky-eyes off the dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.11,0:29:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗林斯！到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rollins! What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.61,0:29:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把目标丢了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost the subject, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.48,0:29:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,各单位撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.76,0:29:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走吧 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.07,0:30:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.12,0:30:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么样的生物学家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of biologist are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.65,0:30:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的搭档死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.15,0:30:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到是你 不是莉萨 回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted you. Not Lisa, you. I want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.49,0:30:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己也想弄明白 但我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to understand this myself. It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.68,0:30:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在先回警局 重新部署\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go to the station and regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能带我回警局 你是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't take me to the police, you're a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.35,0:30:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我在警局的 威廉一定会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll know I'm in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.48,0:30:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.45,0:30:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 算了吧 - 特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let go! - Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.55,0:30:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 哥们 是我刘易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hey, dude, it's Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.72,0:30:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今天查的… - 我不去警局！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About your Bell Ranger… - I'm not going to the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.53,0:30:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里完全没有记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tail number doesn't show up in any of our databases.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你要到医院检查一下你的眼睛有没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should go get your eyes checked, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.29,0:30:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.29,0:31:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,培根被杀了 一点没错 培根被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacon is murder. That's right, people, bacon is murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.57,0:31:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就在早饭的时候 培根被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right! Breakfast kills. Bacon is murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.58,0:31:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.78,0:31:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一让！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.69,0:31:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.11,0:31:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边 这边！快走 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! This way! This way! Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.39,0:31:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.41,0:32:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.07,0:32:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.59,0:32:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.96,0:33:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.71,0:34:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他刚回来 我待会再回你电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he just walked in. Listen, I gotta call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.58,0:34:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？-嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.09,0:34:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经收到消息了 她是位好警察 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all pretty shaken up around here. She was a good cop, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.52,0:34:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是位好警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she was a little more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.46,0:34:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,道尔顿博士 要喝点什么吗？水还是咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Dalton, can I get you anything? Some water, coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.90,0:34:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一台电脑 一条安全网线 和一个私人空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a laptop, a secure landline, and some privacy would be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.20,0:34:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以到外面聊几句吗？-失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I talk to you outside for a second? - Yeah. Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.88,0:35:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本在耍我们 他们原本就知道凶手是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are fucking with us, they know who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.29,0:35:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 下命令 让我逮捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, give the command, we'll go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.12,0:35:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手下100多人在街上巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got 100 cops that wanna hit the streets,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.39,0:35:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时能逮捕那兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And run that shit bag down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.06,0:35:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我收到的指令是按兵不动 所以你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my orders are to hold them back, and that means you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.56,0:35:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么指令？谁的指令？他们的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What orders? Whose orders, theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.39,0:35:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管这什么狗屁指令 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about taking bad orders, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.80,0:35:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制一下你的个人情绪 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep your personal beefs out of this, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.73,0:35:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to plant evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始委屈强权的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you start bending over for the big boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.14,0:35:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看错你了 - 随便你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't even recognize you anymore. - You did what you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.64,0:35:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望你回避一下 - 回避什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I need you to walk away. - Walk away from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.18,0:35:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回避什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.62,0:35:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底知道现在什么状况吗？-我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what's out there, don't you? - I know enough to leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.05,0:35:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we hold her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.13,0:35:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到联邦调查员来接管 接下来的就跟我们无关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till the Feds get here, we transfer custody, and we're home free.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.83,0:35:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.80,0:35:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就这样结案 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another case cleared, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要让你到看守间去 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're moving you to a holding cell. - I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.54,0:36:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到联邦调查局的人到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just till the Feds get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Feds?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.55,0:36:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了你的个人安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.16,0:37:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计 她就交给你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, she's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.74,0:37:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.31,0:37:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去之前 或许你应该先上一下洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna use the restroom before you go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.41,0:37:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的洗手间非常脏 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those holding cell toilets can get pretty nasty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.98,0:37:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在那边 让我带她去吧？-好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's over there. You want me to take her? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.19,0:37:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 你懂的 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep walking. You heard me, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.07,0:37:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！到二楼去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Fast. Second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.10,0:37:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在外面 别耍什么把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right outside, don't try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.47,0:38:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 查斯理 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Chesley. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.57,0:38:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你没问题吧？我先上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind watching the head? I gotta run back upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.34,0:38:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 我负责带她进去 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You go on, then. We'll take it from here. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.68,0:38:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走 这边 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, this way. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.23,0:39:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要帮我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.21,0:39:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道这莉萨因为什么而死 马上告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know why Lisa died. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.98,0:40:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.71,0:40:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.51,0:40:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么告诉我所有事情 要么我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me everything you know, or we're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.29,0:40:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不可以回去 - 但我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't go back there! - But I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.26,0:40:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.33,0:40:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧！我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.90,0:40:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, put that on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.97,0:40:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？-出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.85,0:40:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是一个警察 麻烦把他的资料给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he's just a cop, for Christ's sake. Get me a fix on him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.29,0:40:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕着湖区转90度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a 90-degree swing around the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.13,0:40:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有桥 直到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no bridge, until here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.79,0:40:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定躲在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which would put them in this general vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.76,0:40:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果特纳让道尔顿说出来 那就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Turner gets Dalton to talk, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.43,0:40:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们全完了 - 不会的 我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For all of us. - He won't, that's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.37,0:41:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,西雅图巡逻队在联合海湾附近发现一辆野马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seattle patrol unit has found a Mustang abandoned near Union Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.93,0:41:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把特纳的照片传到网上 还有电视台 通缉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put Turner out over the Net, and get his picture to the local TV stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.77,0:41:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.38,0:41:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然有人能让我们阵脚大乱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does someone like that just slip out of our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.82,0:41:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经很了不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've really outdone yourselves this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.78,0:41:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般人都现在都会慌乱不堪 至少你还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually when you people make a mess, at least you can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.55,0:41:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.33,0:41:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.17,0:41:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在第五街设立路障\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need assistance setting up a roadblock at the 5th Street Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.23,0:41:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,23单位 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 23, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.13,0:41:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 赶快 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on. Get in, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.14,0:41:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干什么？-我们不能停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we doing? - We gotta keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.36,0:41:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果停下来 一定会被警察发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stay in one place, the cops will catch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.02,0:41:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真有一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.19,0:42:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了你 我只是要情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing this for you. I need information.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.44,0:42:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.42,0:42:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前 一组分子生物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years ago, a team of molecular biologists,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.09,0:42:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,破译了人体透明分子的基因编码\N{\fnArial\fs30}broke the code for human invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.59,0:42:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但几乎同一天晚上 这个项目就被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the program was scrapped, almost overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.23,0:42:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.32,0:42:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位主要人员被谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the two of the first team were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.93,0:42:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是什么东西出现了严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something went seriously wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.37,0:42:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年之后 莱塞得到国防部的资助\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year later, Reisner started up again,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.69,0:42:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗地里重组了研究队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}with covert funding from the DOD.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.47,0:42:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动编号是无声游侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The operation was codenamed Silent Knight, with a "K".
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.00,0:42:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.17,0:42:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的是为了研发终极的国家安全武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea was to create the ultimate national security weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.51,0:42:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个透明的军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}an undetectable soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.61,0:42:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱塞授命还原最初的研究结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reisner managed to reproduce the original test results.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.71,0:42:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让我负责修正里面一些缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he called me in to correct the defects.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.76,0:43:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,透明代码结构有一个缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a flaw in the invisibility code.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.79,0:43:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清可以让人体组织透明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum turns human tissue invisible,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.76,0:43:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有严重的并发影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it also has horrible side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.79,0:43:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单来说 它能让光线穿过身体…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply put, the serum allows light to pass directly through us…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.53,0:43:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看到了 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.81,0:43:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 不过放射物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but the radiation…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.86,0:43:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只需要跟我说那透明人 - 会破坏细胞组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell me about the guy. - It damages your cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.81,0:43:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间长了 就会杀死细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over time, it kills them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.89,0:43:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把科学理论的部分略掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skip the science lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.97,0:43:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要跟我说那透明人 简单一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me about him, and make it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.01,0:43:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.07,0:43:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,生还测试项目 并不理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying test subjects, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.88,0:43:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们制造了一种叫「缓冲剂」的化合物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I developed a compound called "the buffer",
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持他的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.69,0:43:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字叫 麦克尔·格里芬\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Michael Griffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.02,0:43:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是特种部队 曾经去过阿富汗 伊朗 还有伊拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was Special Forces. He'd been in Afghanistan, Iran, and Iraq.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.26,0:43:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.53,0:43:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像要点火起飞一样 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm about to blast off. I feel ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.24,0:43:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们给我这个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Doc, for this opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.21,0:44:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.65,0:44:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,道尔顿博士 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Dalton. Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.16,0:44:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.09,0:44:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照顾我啊 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take good care of me, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.43,0:44:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他情况如何？-血压正常 心率正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's he doing? - Blood pressure normal, heart rate normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.79,0:44:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤电流响应为低压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Galvanic skin response shows low stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.23,0:44:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.84,0:44:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.90,0:45:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱塞跟我说测试很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reisner told me our test went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.53,0:45:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来有一次我们给他缓冲剂的时候 他突然死亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when they gave him the buffer a few days later, he suddenly died.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.41,0:45:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知何故缓冲剂失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow the buffer had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.58,0:45:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我一直责怪自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I blamed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.75,0:45:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法面对这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.62,0:45:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱塞允许我退出 但我没有放弃研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reisner let me go, but I couldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.71,0:45:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道为什么缓冲剂会失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to know why the buffer failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.85,0:45:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今晚我终于知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tonight I found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.49,0:45:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓冲剂没有失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}The buffer didn't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.47,0:45:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们从来没有给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never gave it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.80,0:46:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是所谓维护世界和平的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all about making the world a safer place.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.84,0:46:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 光荣任务啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.54,0:46:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Command,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.09,0:46:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,市内所有的桥梁和路口都已设立路障\N{\fnArial\fs30}checkpoints at every bridge and road out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.29,0:46:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果特纳和道尔顿尝试离开西雅图 我们会逮捕他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Turner and Dalton try to leave Seattle tonight, we'll catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.97,0:46:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要担心的不仅仅是一个警察 你意识到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just the cop we have to worry about, you realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.80,0:46:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面还有一个隐形的刺客要对付我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got an invisible assassin out there fighting his own war.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会把他带回来的 - 你对他的控制权早就没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I'll bring him in. - You've lost control of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.00,0:46:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬一直从事特务工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin's always operated on the edge of anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.64,0:46:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在军营的时候已经十分深沉忧郁\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he goes into combat, he goes deep, he goes black.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.37,0:46:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想想他凭什么听你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why the hell would he listen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.27,0:46:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是名军人 我还是他长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still a soldier, and I'm still his CO.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.77,0:46:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬没有得到他的缓冲剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin cannot get the buffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.02,0:46:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.92,0:46:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他找出来 然后处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you find him, and end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.58,0:46:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 不会让他找到道尔顿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, he won't get to Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.89,0:47:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让她出什么乱子 以至于牵扯到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happens to her. Nothing that involves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.90,0:47:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗？-明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we clear? - We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.50,0:47:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.88,0:47:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有九条留言 要听你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nine new messages. To listen to your…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.68,0:48:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 电视上说要通缉你 你在哪啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, I saw it on TV. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.66,0:48:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问到埃德蒙的渡轮现在还有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the ferry to Edmonds still run at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.07,0:48:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.49,0:48:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢吃金枪鱼罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you like canned tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.76,0:48:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请讲 - 刚刚发现了道尔顿的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bishop here. - Dalton's cell just went hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.73,0:48:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,定位需要多长时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long till you get a fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.47,0:48:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在定位 长官 一分钟之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're triangulating now, sir, should be less than a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.94,0:48:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.04,0:48:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 继续说关于格里芬的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so finish telling me about this Michael Griffin guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.51,0:48:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他要说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.88,0:48:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了 我只见过他几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, I only met him a couple of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.01,0:49:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是军人 有特别使命 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the guy's a soldier. He's held in high regard, you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.85,0:49:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.08,0:49:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给他特别训练 还投入大量资金在这项目上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they spent years training him, millions on the program,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.62,0:49:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么要杀死他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are they trying to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.99,0:49:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea, Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.89,0:49:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你真的很差劲 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're really on the ball, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.69,0:49:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很意外你怎么会什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised you weren't running the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.52,0:49:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一从事研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in research.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.09,0:49:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,军事部门的事情我从来不过问\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Department of killing must've been down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你在那工作那么长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you telling me the whole time you were there,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.97,0:49:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然什么都没去了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't ask one single question?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.14,0:49:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是干我觉得值得的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was doing something bigger than myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.23,0:49:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只为了国家安全工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was working for national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.04,0:49:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你真的很爱国 我现在觉得很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how patriotic of you. I feel so much more secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.18,0:49:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what now, genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.94,0:49:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面左拐 上洲际高速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a left up there, get on the interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.22,0:49:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时后就能到俄勒冈州 他也找不到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}In two hours we'll be in Oregon. He'll never find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.86,0:49:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么想法 要跟一个透明人玩捉迷藏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your big plan, play hide and seek with the invisible guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.62,0:49:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有缓冲剂 血清会破坏他的组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the buffer, the serum's attacking his organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.16,0:49:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他活不了一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't live for more than a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.59,0:49:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪都不去 那个兔崽子害死了莉萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere. That bastard killed my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.70,0:49:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能就这样跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not turning my back on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.63,0:49:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她曾经努力的保护过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.10,0:49:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一开始就告诉我们真相 也许她就不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might still be alive if you'd told the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.75,0:50:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到一条信息 几分钟之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a message. A couple of minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.62,0:50:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.53,0:50:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想让自己回去当诱饵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just turned yourself into a tracking beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.12,0:50:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才想给我妹妹打个电话 告诉她我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to call my sister, let her know that I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.63,0:50:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,短讯是谁给你发的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.27,0:50:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人几个月来都一直给我发信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this guy's been texting me for months,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.40,0:50:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我为莱塞工作开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since I started working for Reisner.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.17,0:50:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是些小提示 没有什么特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little warnings. Nothing specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.14,0:50:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他突然不发了 直到刚才为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he stopped, till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.24,0:50:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁 一定知道你家被袭击的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever it is must've known about the attack on your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.64,0:50:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也一定有跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be tracking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.81,0:50:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.82,0:50:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,勒德洛路2058号 找给你发短讯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}2058 Ludlow. Meet your pen pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.65,0:50:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么确定他不是坏人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know he's not one of the bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.23,0:50:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 赌一把吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.87,0:51:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都不喜欢晚上工作 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people hate working nights, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.48,0:51:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我却不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I don't mind it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.78,0:51:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为安静 能静心的思考问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quiet. You can hear yourself think.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.45,0:51:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.12,0:51:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.46,0:51:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我很讨厌这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this place more than you could know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.32,0:51:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过肯定不是每个人都讨厌这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not for everybody, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.30,0:51:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不是每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.97,0:51:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.57,0:51:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问你 小姐 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, ma'am. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.34,0:51:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道比斯上校在哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where I could find Colonel Bishop?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.11,0:51:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左手边的最后一扇门 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the last door on your left. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.98,0:51:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音很有磁性 你是北卡人对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a nice voice. That's North Carolina, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.69,0:51:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.55,0:51:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是切里波因特人对吧 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherry Point, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.26,0:52:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherry…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.86,0:52:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪她的号码 查一下她最后打给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then back trace her number. I want to know who made that last call.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.07,0:52:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息就通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me when you get a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.15,0:52:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I checked it out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.35,0:52:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个酒鬼 也许就流浪汉 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a few winos on the nod, maybe a couple homeless, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.32,0:52:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 仅此而已？你确定？-是的 我哪敢骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? Hey, hey, you sure? - Yeah, Scout's honor, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.06,0:52:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.59,0:52:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 有什么需要随时找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime, Officer. I love this undercover shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.23,0:52:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.87,0:52:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该从后门进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you might wanna use the back entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.40,0:52:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来比较舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells better.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.55,0:52:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是比斯 - 我们发现一条发给她的短信 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bishop. - We pulled the message, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.11,0:52:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁发的？-无法辨别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who sent it? - Caller's ID was scrambled,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.88,0:52:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在尝试破译\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's being decrypted as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.28,0:53:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经有信息的内容了 现在传到你的屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have the text right here, it should be coming up on your screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.12,0:53:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息是什么时候发送的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time was it sent?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.86,0:53:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔 还在吗？喂喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Moore, hello? You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.71,0:53:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克尔 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.05,0:53:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 关于这一切我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I really am sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.14,0:53:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚的片刻我还以为我被原谅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for a second there I thought I was actually forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.64,0:54:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在追踪她 告诉我 她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're tracking her, tell me where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.28,0:54:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要找马吉·道尔顿 我能给你缓冲剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need Maggie Dalton. I can get you the buffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.12,0:54:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你要从归我部下 你玩过火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've gotta come back in. You've gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.29,0:54:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我凭什么要相信一个叛国者 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now why would I trust a traitor? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.85,0:54:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一手培养我 却又让他们来毁掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You set me up. You let them destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.76,0:54:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想多了 麦克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can't be that naive, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.10,0:54:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是为了要确保项目的完成性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed a fail-safe to protect the integrity of the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.94,0:54:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.97,0:54:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经救过你 当你在伊拉克做了那件事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you. After what you did in Iraq.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.36,0:54:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救我是为了让我成为你们的实验品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me to be a goddamn guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.45,0:54:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是这项实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for this project,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.28,0:54:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经被送上军事法庭判为战犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd have been court-martialed for war crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.29,0:54:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,并送到监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and boxed off to Leavenworth!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.56,0:54:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢笔 你用这破钢笔刺我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pen? You stab me with a goddamn pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.90,0:54:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你动作最好快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.53,0:54:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就来收拾你 我现在就来收拾你 比斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming to get you. I'm coming to get you, Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.27,0:55:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完蛋了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.84,0:55:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你是个怎样的军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what kind of soldier you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.01,0:55:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快装上子弹啊！军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load that gun, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.90,0:55:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了 你根本分辨不出你的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost it. Lost sight of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.16,0:56:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比过去更清楚自己的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the enemy clearer than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.04,0:56:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们随处可见 有时候就在你眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're everywhere. Sometimes right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.04,0:56:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗？我可以去任何地方 看见任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand? I can go anywhere, see anything, anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.91,0:56:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当人觉得孤独的时候 也许我就在他们身边陪着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with people when they think they're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.65,0:56:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克尔 - 我能看见他们干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael. - I see what they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.59,0:56:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也知道他们想什么 实在让人厌恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what they're thinking. It disgusts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.62,0:56:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不值得生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't deserve to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.82,0:56:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也完成了我们的任务 加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to finish our mission, Gavin,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.23,0:56:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也阻止不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're not gonna stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.91,0:56:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,勒德洛路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ludlow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.75,0:56:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就到 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I come, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.54,0:56:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的情报 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the tip, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.69,0:58:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.50,0:58:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.84,0:58:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.74,0:58:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吗？不好意思 比斯上校 我刚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Excuse me, Colonel Bishop, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.99,0:59:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到我的信息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my message.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.57,0:59:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别照我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No light. No light.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.86,0:59:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.97,0:59:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不要用手电照我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wish you hadn't done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.64,0:59:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.87,0:59:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂莫西·劳伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timothy Laurents.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.71,0:59:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过只是一个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's just a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.51,0:59:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了 道尔顿博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long since erased, Dr. Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.05,0:59:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手举起来 - 我没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put your hands where I can see them. - I'm harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.53,0:59:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我患有三种末期癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have three rare cancers,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.10,0:59:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分器官溃烂了 而且不能见光\N{\fnArial\fs30}any number of failing organs, and a total intolerance to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.31,1:00:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day, I'm just a little more dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.21,1:00:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况还一直在恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a little more visible.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.51,1:00:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.62,1:00:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were others.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.75,1:00:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上一共三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were three, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.66,1:00:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号八天前死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one lasted eight days.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.03,1:00:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是二号 至于三号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm number two. And number three, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.43,1:00:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你已经见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you've already met.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.18,1:00:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？-长官 比斯上校他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - It's Colonel Bishop, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.38,1:00:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.58,1:00:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.12,1:00:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清保险库安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.69,1:00:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保险库很安全 长官 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The vauIt's secure, sir. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.76,1:00:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 清理现场 - 但是 长官…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clean this up. - But, sir, I…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.93,1:00:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚接到通知 自然科学委员会的主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the chairman of the House Science Committee,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.03,1:01:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天会来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.23,1:01:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.62,1:01:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,无声游侠行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Silent Knight,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.59,1:01:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不是为了国家安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}was never about national security.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.89,1:01:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了政治需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only about political security.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.16,1:01:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 参议员保罗·海耶斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Senator Paul Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.77,1:01:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,4月21日 死于支气管窒息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died of acute asthmatic asphyxiation on April 21.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.60,1:01:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他的呼吸器就在他旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}His inhaler untouched at his bedside.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.78,1:01:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀亚特·杰连斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wyatt Jennings.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.67,1:01:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,第九巡回法院法官 4月27日在纵目睽睽下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninth Circuit judge, broke his neck falling down a staircase,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.95,1:01:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔下楼梯 劲骨折断而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by witnesses, April 27.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.99,1:01:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,马失前蹄啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clumsy feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.40,1:02:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是… - 沃伦·艾申堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that… - Warren Eschenburg.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.43,1:02:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,前中情局的行政主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retired CIA operations chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.19,1:02:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在自己的渔船上堕海身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fell off his fishing boat and drowned.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.83,1:02:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,5月3日\N{\fnArial\fs30}May 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.24,1:02:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是要杀死他政治上的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's killing their political enemies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.00,1:02:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这里的其他人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then why all of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.48,1:02:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来的受害者已经没有目的性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then the victims become more randomized.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.42,1:02:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just regular people.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.65,1:02:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个中产妇女 一个卡车司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soccer mom, a truck driver,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.88,1:02:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个银行家 一个探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}an investment banker, a detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.05,1:02:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是西北部的人 就在过去的两个周\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clustered in the Northwest, in the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.96,1:02:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是想掩人耳目 - 我想这是他的真正目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's trying to cover up his true agenda. - I think that is his true agenda.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.33,1:02:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to end this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.97,1:02:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 消防火梯在哪？-那边 靠南面的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the fire escape? - Over there. South wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.24,1:02:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.71,1:02:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. It's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.42,1:03:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, I got it. Okay, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.02,1:03:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.41,1:03:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欣赏你 特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.24,1:04:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有办法 的确是个好战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your own little nine-to-five way, you are a true warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.72,1:04:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管来吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it happen, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.43,1:04:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.63,1:04:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着镜子的感觉很痛苦吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts to look in the mirror, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.93,1:05:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.67,1:05:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里？-我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.31,1:05:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Laurents?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.56,1:05:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.70,1:06:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么办法能阻止他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hit a wall. How do we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.07,1:06:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. You're the cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.33,1:06:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.96,1:07:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你送到车站 然后送你上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take you to the station, put you on a bus.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.40,1:07:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到从来没去过的地方躲起来一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head someplace you've never been, lay low for a few months.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.66,1:07:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.77,1:07:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢 你不来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.17,1:07:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经告诉我足够的资料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given me all the information I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.99,1:07:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的就交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle the rest from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.91,1:07:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还想逮捕格里芬吗？-我没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're still gonna go after Griffin? - I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.94,1:07:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么找到他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna find him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.28,1:07:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时还没想到什么对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't quite figured that part out yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.54,1:07:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个你会用吧？-嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know how to use one of these? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.76,1:07:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你怎么保护自己？-我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you gonna protect yourself? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.06,1:07:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人说我的笑容很亲切 也许会有用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}People say I have a nice smile, maybe that'll help.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.86,1:07:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法弄支抢 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get another gun, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.24,1:07:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,到报社去吧 我要联系时代杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna go to 24th and main. I have a contact at The Times.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.34,1:07:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你以为一堆打字机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think a bunch of nerds with typewriters,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.11,1:07:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮你抵挡格里芬吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are gonna protect you from Griffin?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.31,1:07:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在寻求保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking for protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.54,1:07:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你是想干什么？-把事情了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you looking for? - To finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.34,1:07:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要揭发真相 不让莱塞继续妄为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get the word out, it'll stop Reisner from coming after us,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.18,1:07:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬将是他最后一只棋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Griffin will be the last of his kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.05,1:08:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你一露面 格里芬就会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you go public, Griffin's gonna be coming right at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.38,1:08:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.93,1:08:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要也这做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.33,1:08:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我也没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.37,1:08:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坚持的话 我想我对你的印象会有改观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you keep this up, I might change my mind about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.24,1:08:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要 在我眼里你还是个笨警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother. I still think you're a big dumb cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.28,1:08:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过确有亲切的笑容 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you do have a nice smile. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.25,1:08:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给我妹妹打个电话保平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna call my sister and tell her I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.22,1:08:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.30,1:08:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查人员仍然封锁昨晚的事发现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investigators remain at the scene of last night's police incident,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.70,1:08:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管目前还没有透露事件最新的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and although there have been no new details revealed regarding this case,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.94,1:09:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方只希望大家能协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}law enforcement officials are now requesting the public's assistance,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.55,1:09:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,通缉嫌疑人弗兰克·特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}in tracking down this individual.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.68,1:09:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克·特纳持有武器 是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Turner is considered armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.69,1:09:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体特征是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is described as…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.12,1:09:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫 别叫了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.20,1:09:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 有信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got a signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.33,1:09:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,20秒 然后把电池摘掉 知道了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty seconds, then you pull the battery, got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.60,1:09:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,希瑟 是希瑟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather. Heather?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.87,1:09:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.95,1:09:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是格里芬 他想要见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Griffin. He wants to meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.72,1:09:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我救他 否则他会杀了希瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I save his life or I lose my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.65,1:09:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.93,1:09:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他说如果除了我还有其他人的话 他会杀了希瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. He said, anyone shows up but me, Heather dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.29,1:09:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他会放过你们俩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's gonna let you go, the both of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.30,1:09:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但我要赌一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.57,1:09:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要赌一把 哪里能搞到缓冲剂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to try. Where do you get the buffer?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.94,1:09:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要自己做缓冲剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to make it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.33,1:10:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,德贝大学有一个正规的实验室 我要到那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}U-Dub has a decent lab. I can get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.41,1:10:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想在哪里见面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he wanna meet?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.22,1:10:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉 你不能一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, you can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.75,1:10:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想在哪里见面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he wanna meet?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.25,1:10:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我7点钟到国王郡车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just said to be at the King County Terminal at 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.36,1:12:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克·特纳持有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Turner is considered,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.06,1:12:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是危险人物 - 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- armed and dangerous. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.80,1:12:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希瑟 - 别 马吉 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heather. - No, Maggie, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.96,1:12:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.61,1:12:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.06,1:12:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.56,1:12:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,希瑟 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, go. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.19,1:12:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.93,1:12:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.67,1:12:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.48,1:12:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,光线像火烧一样 情况越来越严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The light burns. It's worse than ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.62,1:13:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我说的办 否则我就出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do everything I say, or I'm gonna walk out of here,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.71,1:13:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你妹妹杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill your sister right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.39,1:13:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把衣服脱掉 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take off your clothes. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.72,1:13:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？-别问了 就按我说的办！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Oh, please, just do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.66,1:13:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克尔 放心吧 我可以… - 马上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael, let's just go. I can make… - Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.30,1:13:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a visual on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.73,1:13:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后机会 快脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now for the last time, strip.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.34,1:13:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.08,1:13:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've always liked you, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.75,1:13:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他离开视线 他就是疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him out of your sight. That's our guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.80,1:13:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 请问一下现在几点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, you know what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.33,1:13:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是探员弗兰克·特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Detective Frank Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.60,1:13:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你姐姐一起来的 - 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here with your sister. - No…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.76,1:13:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道她现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.87,1:13:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离我远点 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just stay away from me. - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.26,1:13:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的 没事的 不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's going to be okay. I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.61,1:13:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你不走我就叫了 - 希瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'll scream. - Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.87,1:13:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别通知西雅图警方 别让他们扣留了特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let Seattle PD take Turner into custody,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.99,1:13:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.41,1:14:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不管你用什么手段 就这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.82,1:14:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.15,1:14:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服 裤子 内衣 全脱掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shirt, pants, underwear, the whole enchilada.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.02,1:14:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么要帮忙的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.72,1:14:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.12,1:14:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常合适 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.13,1:14:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. That's what we like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.53,1:14:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.30,1:14:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.57,1:14:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他们去哪了 拜托你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell me where they are. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.21,1:14:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去商店了吗？进去商店了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the store? In the store?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.13,1:14:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.88,1:14:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑了 请求支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a runner. I need backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.45,1:14:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.33,1:14:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不够了 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's up, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.62,1:14:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你和我从这里一起走出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're walking out of here together.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.23,1:14:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让你试试你自己的药剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you get a taste of your own medicine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.60,1:14:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 小朋友 别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, girl, don't scream.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.16,1:14:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！我告诉过你一个人来的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you! I told you to come alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.00,1:15:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这婊子（菊花残？）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.34,1:15:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.48,1:15:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,希瑟 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.45,1:15:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.02,1:15:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.35,1:15:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,希瑟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.93,1:15:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.07,1:15:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.77,1:15:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别开枪 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, don't shoot. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.27,1:15:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用紧张 我是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.84,1:15:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.48,1:15:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.01,1:15:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面 进去 走 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside. Let's go! Come on, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.32,1:15:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我慢慢放下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm gonna put it down, slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.96,1:15:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.23,1:16:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.03,1:16:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 别开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fucking fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.94,1:16:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 所有人 别开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, all units, hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.67,1:16:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.78,1:16:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另一队人到后面去 - 他跑不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get another team around the back! - He's got nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.95,1:16:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让一让 - 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out of the way. Move. - Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.53,1:16:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,汇报情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.77,1:16:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳在里面 特警已经准备把门打开进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner's in the bag, SWAT's breaching the security gate as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.47,1:16:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,道尔顿跟格里芬呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Dalton and Griffin?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.04,1:16:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们还在不在里面 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if they're still inside, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.84,1:16:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 你不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.10,1:16:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很不乐观 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are very fluid, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.72,1:16:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳 我们知道你在里面 你出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner, we know who you are. Just come on out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.46,1:17:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么处理目前的糟糕情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a plan to resolve this fucking situation or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.63,1:17:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚到一边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the hell out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.81,1:17:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.50,1:18:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 等一下 你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, wait. Wait! You need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.86,1:18:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以通知研究所在10分钟内给你缓存剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can call the Institute and have the buffer here in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 留心听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.64,1:18:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个项目可以继续 我跟你合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This program can go on. I'll make you a partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.42,1:18:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了共同目标合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working together for a greater purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.51,1:18:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个警察已经解决了 麦克尔 现在只有我跟你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cop's taken care of, Michael, it's just us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.05,1:18:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是麦克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.43,1:18:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.56,1:18:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.86,1:18:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？你能从我眼里看出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know? Can you see it in my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.97,1:18:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 对就这样 继续往后退吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just back away, that's what you do best.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.49,1:19:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是专门给烧伤患者的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}These clothes are for burn patients.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.19,1:19:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能够帮你抵抗光线 直到缓冲剂生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll protect you from the light until the buffer kicks in.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.20,1:19:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多长时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will it take?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.03,1:19:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就会没事的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should feel relief soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.14,1:19:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手给我 - 你先注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me your arm. - You first.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.40,1:19:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一半 我一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half for you, half for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.21,1:19:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢确定注射一半是否有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be certain it'll work without a full dose.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.31,1:19:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,先给你注射一下 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's give it a shot, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.68,1:19:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.88,1:19:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的 我不相信你 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't trust you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.89,1:19:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 真听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.77,1:20:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.22,1:20:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是用以前的学生的账号登记这实验室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I booked this room on my expired student pass code,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.12,1:20:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你想干嘛 我希望你快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so whatever decision you intend to make, I suggest you make it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.82,1:20:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.73,1:20:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以后不需要再注射了吧？-不 以后还要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't need this again, will I? - No, this will do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.38,1:20:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 血管就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still. - There's the vein, right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.72,1:20:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.75,1:20:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.29,1:21:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个英雄啊 马吉 跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a true hero, Maggie. Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.50,1:21:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你已经得到你想要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you got what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.80,1:21:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfection.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.04,1:21:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少人有生之年都想追求完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people in their lifetime get to achieve it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.91,1:21:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的丈夫 完美的父亲 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect husband, perfect father, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.65,1:21:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不是 但我是完美的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am none of these things, but I am the perfect weapon,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.49,1:21:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你帮我实现完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you perfected me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.29,1:21:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以随时随意亲近任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get this close to people without them ever knowing I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.19,1:21:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起了 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.99,1:21:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真聪明啊！马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very clever! Very clever, Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.03,1:22:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你是最有吸引力的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a spirited little minx, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.06,1:22:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉 你为什么要逃呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Maggie, what are you running for?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.97,1:22:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.98,1:22:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑快点啊！马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on there, Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.15,1:22:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点！甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.88,1:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要捉到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.52,1:22:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛要跑呢？甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, why are you running, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.72,1:22:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是会捉到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna find you later,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.82,1:22:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我把衣服脱掉 就能把你捉住\N{\fnArial\fs30}take off all my clothes, and catch you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.09,1:22:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.53,1:22:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.57,1:22:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.40,1:22:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.80,1:22:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,马吉 你干了什么？马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie. What did you do, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.05,1:22:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.47,1:22:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.57,1:23:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.76,1:23:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.46,1:23:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马吉 快进去 - 特纳 他在你后面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie, get inside. - Turner, he's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.36,1:23:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了 特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.27,1:23:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.00,1:23:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.20,1:23:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.64,1:24:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 你死定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! - You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.75,1:24:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你死定了！你个小屁孩 - 放开他 放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really are a pain in the ass! - Let him go. Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.68,1:24:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特纳？-你这兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turner? - You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.43,1:24:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.19,1:24:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无处可逃了 马吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere left to run, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.40,1:24:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我干了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.67,1:25:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射的是什么药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was in that vial, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.21,1:25:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭鼠药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rat poison.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.08,1:25:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭鼠药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rat poison?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.41,1:25:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 实在太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just great. Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.85,1:25:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这笨女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.45,1:25:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你自己也害死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed yourself, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.39,1:25:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀鼠灵 C19-H16-O4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warfarin, C19-H16-O4.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.29,1:25:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的血液会稀释 心跳也加速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood thins out, your heart speeds up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.87,1:25:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后出血而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hemorrhaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.74,1:25:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我告诉过你要好好照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I distinctly remember telling you to take good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.69,1:25:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你实在太不称职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a real shitty job.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.54,1:26:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗？特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel it yet, Turner?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.17,1:26:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它给你带来了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it does to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.14,1:26:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.42,1:26:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.94,1:27:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still no sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.03,1:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.87,1:27:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.71,1:27:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to.
